    <title>Vol.24学霸/富二代/百灵鸟：即兴喜剧的“复仇者联盟”诞生记！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685e763cbef90978ec365313</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685e763cbef90978ec365313</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Jun 2025 10:51:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：焦丸熊、妍子、八全、韩诗怡</span></p><span></span><p><span>找点乐子加入新鲜血液啦！！继上一期揭秘了致达的工地经历之后，这一期，我们继续探索喜剧演员不为人知的另一面。</span></p><span></span><p><span>三个喜剧新人犹如职业版的“复仇者联盟”，万万没想到，这样也能走上即兴喜剧之路？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>即兴的精神到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>舞台上那些刁钻怪异的奇妙之旅，能和人生有多大关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span>反差的背后，他们在即兴里找到了什么？这些又怎么改变了他们？</span></p><span></span><p><span>即兴不是“没准备”的借口，而是“敢面对”的超能力！</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起来听听，历史的偶然性和必然性的结合，新人们的即兴之路~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 令人窒息的学霸？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 健康版富二代！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a> 老谋深算的百灵鸟？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> &nbsp;胡同里解锁即兴隐形关卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 撒谎的天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 没有剧本，太好了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a> 身边人认可很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> 活在当下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1489">24:49</a> 每个人都是主角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 被看到很重要</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhc5JEFKvTvSf459pEZy4N6E92gn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（演员左起：焦丸熊、妍子、韩诗怡、八全）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>宝子们！爆笑故事征集令来啦！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>家人们，我们几个主播的“社死/高光/离谱”经历都快被掏空啦！现在轮到你们上场——快来分享你的【真人真事爆笑经历】，让我们笑到扶墙！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>投稿要求：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>必须是亲身经历！编的可逃不过我们的火眼金睛！</span></p><span></span><p><span>越离谱越好！翻车现场/迷惑对话/奇葩偶遇…统统砸过来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>文字100-300字为佳，故事越生动，被翻牌概率越高！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>被选中的故事：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>有机会被改编成段子，在我们的博客“C位出道”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>️抽3位幸运儿送出独家定制表情包/神秘周边！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>投稿方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>点击↓群二维码，进群私信客服</span></p><span></span><p><span>️</span><strong><span>温馨提示：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>故事一旦投稿默认授权我们二次创作，社死情节请保护好他人隐私哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>速速交出你们的快乐源泉，让我们笑到明年！！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmpGzrI3RxkBp_BgEeYcCaMx032n.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>选题：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：妍子</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>运营：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>出品：找点乐子新喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：找点乐子新喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>想看线下演出:</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加客服VX：zhaodianlezi9527</span></p>]]></description>
