  <item>
    <title>Vol.22 京东美团的外卖大战，比我的公司晚了10年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681485d347ebeede7e75fb76</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681485d347ebeede7e75fb76</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 May 2025 09:08:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：Eric、佳彤、路客、致达、焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>点外卖，你是用饿了么、美团，还是京东？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Eric的答案是：15年前，我用我自己写的程序。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个喜剧演员，曾经竟是估值上亿公司的合伙人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些年，白领接过的小卡片里，藏了什么玄机？</span></p><span></span><p><span>比美团还早的外卖平台，是怎样服务8个城市、几千栋写字楼的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2000多万的资金，你会怎么花？花光了，怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，主播变成了嘉宾，神秘身份终得揭晓。</span></p><span></span><p><span>快来和找点乐子er们一起听听，Eric的创业故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a>每天中午吃饭，是个痛点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>最初的产品形态，有多简陋？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a>每天上百个人找我要饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a>打工是不可能打工了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a>天使轮，一个人150w</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a>2000w，不够烧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a>抢救肯定是要抢救的</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2I0ZTktYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy8wMi9EQi9HS3dSSVc0TDZrdnpBQUNFbUFPbEZaV3ouanBlZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U="></p><span></span><p><span>（演员左起：Eric、佳彤、致达、路客、焦丸熊）</span></p><span></span><p><span>好消息❗️❗️❗️</span></p><span></span><p><span>【找点乐子聊天会】️播客听友会，微信群正式成立啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家加入和演员们积极互动和吐槽生活的烦恼，让我肆无忌惮地笑吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>以后会邀请大家一起来现场录制播客，可以提提各种有意思的想聊的话题呀～</span></p><span></span><p><span>点击↓群二维码，找到组织</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMo9NEGLWw2XQ1U7uTJy04MaWuR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>选题：Eric</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：路客</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：路客</span><