    <title>Vol.14 演员宕机，能让即兴演出变得多危险？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c1550ab0167b8db98f15c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c1550ab0167b8db98f15c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Feb 2025 07:25:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：焦丸熊、Eric、佳彤、路客、致达</span></p><span></span><p><span>即兴表演是一种没有剧本的演出形式，每一场上台，都是一酣畅淋漓的极限运动，在这里，我们的每一次行动都指向未知，每一句台词都充满变数，我们和尴尬硬刚，与危险共舞，是突发状况的老朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，我们就一起聊聊舞台上那些有趣的意外事件，比如：</span></p><span></span><p><span>演反串演动物演鬼，为什么演鬼最轻松？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当观众当场爆料男友劈腿，为何全场最终掌声雷动？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当队友们纷纷感染大脑短路，谁是零号病人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>演到最后就剩三个观众没走，娱乐圈脚腕部演员也有自己的勋章！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听本期播客，一起回顾找点乐子“崩溃”与欢乐并存的演艺之路</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎来看我们的线下演出，见证我们新素材的诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a>演到剩3个观众，是什么感受？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a>鬼上身真的挺累的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a>她带着出轨男友来看即兴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a>有时候，演员比观众看得投入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a>有时候，被支持是让人恐惧的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a>有时候，裤子是需要磨合的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a>焦脑传播综合症是个啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a>50岁的观众，来看烧纸钱？</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy8zMmMzLWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvNEUvNTAvR0FxaG50QUxoTXVsQURJNEFRTm10QUJ4LmpwZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large"><br><span> （演员左起：致达、佳彤、 焦丸熊、 Eric、路客）</span></p><span></span><p><span>选题：Eric</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：路客</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：佳彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>运营：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>出品：找点乐子新喜剧</span></p><