    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b86e7e05a90dfd0dfb703d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Feb 2025 12:43:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：焦丸熊、Eric、佳彤、路客</span></p><span></span><p><span>年后碰头第一聊，果然，我们不一定都看了春晚，但一定都看了春节档。</span></p><span></span><p><span>看的多的，已经全部鉴赏完毕，看的少的，至少也被浪潮推进了影院，参与进了这场给150亿项目升旗的公共仪式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期里，我们发掘出春节档的很多聊法：</span></p><span></span><p><span>某著名喜剧大师：《哪吒2》的喜剧逻辑在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>某深度调查记者：从爽文大男主到“摄像头男主”，为什么封神二的姬发没立住？</span></p><span></span><p><span>某唱唱反调主编：我就不喜欢哪吒，有错吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>某爆假料的业内人：这么多大体量电影挤在了一块儿，背后竟有此等内幕？赢家通吃的市场环境里，非头部影片是否还有生存空间？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听，一起聊聊你心中的春节档</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a>看哪吒1的时候我一直在哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">15:53</a>哪吒2是怎么让三代人共鸣的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a>姬发，你的弧光呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a>封神2就是大写的“不爽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a>哪吒是不是太冲动了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>射雕放了半个小时PPT</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3580">59:40</a>票房惨，是春节档的错吗？</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy8zMmMzLWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvNEUvNTAvR0FxaG50QUxoTXVsQURJNEFRTm10QUJ4LmpwZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large"><br><span>（演员左起：致达、佳彤、 焦丸熊、 Eric、路客）</span></p><span></span><p><span>选题：路客 焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：路客</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：佳彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>运营：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>出品：找点乐子新喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：找点乐子新喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>想看线下演出:</span></p><span></span><p><span>添