  <item>
    <title>Vol.11 和这些玩意儿住一起，你能不弹射吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a1ea2e247d51713c8e17f1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a1ea2e247d51713c8e17f1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Feb 2025 10:33:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：焦丸熊、Eric、佳彤、路客、致达</span></p><span></span><p><span>在家偷喝奶茶的，不一定是杰伦，也可能是杰瑞；夜半轻抚后背的，不一定是小倩，也可能是小强；当四男一女一起开房，不一定是付费频道，也可能是家庭伦理；天热就变质的，不一定是过期的牛奶，也可能是兄弟的眼神。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，找点乐子分享各自奇葩的住宿经历，从学生时代的集体宿舍，到五星级酒店的豪华套房，和这些玩意儿住一起，你能不弹射吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a>我被大学生室友妈电话吵醒而破口大骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a>北京房租一个月180，良心呀&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a>在老板娘屋门口抡拳踢脚&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a>和老板老板娘过年一起包饺砸很尴尬&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a>当四男一女一起开房不一定是付费频道&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a>在西藏旅游酒店洗澡毛巾见红了&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a>和老鼠在床头柜对视我瞬间弹射&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">36:32</a>蟑螂竟然在我后背爬我又弹射了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a>我和高中同学睡一个被窝儿&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a>把去水房学习的室友锁门外一宿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2788">46:28</a>热得快把宿舍桌子烧着集体弹射了&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a>我画女孩头被割下来的画吓宿管阿姨&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3174">52:54</a>我被初中室友偷摸“小焦焦”真硬菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3423">57:03</a>我也想弹射，但被无情的手控制了&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3632">60:32</a>我可以给你*“小焦焦”吗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoEVbb9jIOQFpDbWp6ruYSXOQ6uT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（演员左起：致达、佳彤、 焦丸熊、 Eric、路客）</span></p><span></span><p><span>选题：Eric</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：路客</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：佳彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>运营：焦丸熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>出品：找点乐子新喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：找点乐子新喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>想看线下演出:</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加客服VX：zhaodianlezi9527</span></p>]]></description>
